    <div class="eyebrow" id="eyebrow">Theresienwiese · München · at sunset</div>
    <h1 id="ttl">Wiesn Walk</h1>
    <p class="lede">Golden hour on the Wiesn. You walk as a Bursch in Lederhosen through a street of beer tents, among guests in Dirndl and Tracht. Festhalle Sonnenwirt, ahead on your left, is open: go in for the bandstand, the galleries and a hall that sways to the waltz.</p>
