    <button id="go" disabled>Building the Wiesn…</button>
    <p class="note">The Bursch and Madl were modelled, rigged and animated in Blender. Tent names, facades and the layout are invented. Ein Prosit der Gemütlichkeit by Bernhard Dittrich (1898) is in the public domain. A free app by <a href="https://nassau.se/apps" target="_top">Nassau</a>.</p>
